<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Order Placed - Handmade Treasures</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="5;url=/orders">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #34496e;
      --ink-soft: #7895b2;
      --body-text: #2d3436;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-soft: #f3f4f7;
      --surface-blue: #eef5fb;
      --success: #4CAF50;
      --line: rgba(52, 73, 110, 0.12);
      --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--body-text);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #f3f4f7 100%);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .success-card {
      width: min(100%, 680px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(52, 73, 110, 0.08);
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .success-head {
      padding: 22px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f6eb, var(--surface-blue));
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .success-badge {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--success);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.24);
    }

    .success-head h1 {
      margin: 16px 0 8px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .success-head p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--body-text);
    }

    .success-body {
      padding: 22px 24px 24px;
    }

    .order-meta {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .meta-card {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(52, 73, 110, 0.08);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--surface-soft);
    }

    .meta-label {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }

    .meta-value {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .success-note {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--body-text);
    }

    .success-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .success-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 40px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .success-link-primary {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .success-link-primary:hover {
      background: #3aa8c1;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .success-link-secondary {
      background: var(--surface-blue);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .success-link-secondary:hover {
      background: #dcecf8;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="success-card">
    <section class="success-head">
      <div class="success-badge">✓</div>
      <h1>Your order placed successfully🎉</h1>
      <p>
        We’ve saved your order and you’ll be redirected to your order history in 5 seconds.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="success-body">
      <div class="order-meta">
        <article class="meta-card">
          <p class="meta-label">Order ID</p>
          <p class="meta-value"><%= orderId %></p>
        </article>
        <article class="meta-card">
          <p class="meta-label">Total Amount</p>
          <p class="meta-value">&#8377;<%= totalAmount %></p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="success-note">
        If the page doesn’t redirect automatically, you can use the button below to view your orders right away.
      </p>

      <div class="success-actions">
        <a href="/orders" class="success-link success-link-primary">Go to Order History</a>
        <a href="/products" class="success-link success-link-secondary">Continue Shopping</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    setTimeout(function () {
      window.location.href = "/orders";
    }, 5000);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
